\begin{itemize}
    \item Water--methane--ammonia phase separation under
    \(150\text{--}350~\mathrm{GPa}\).
    \item Stability of superionic H$_2$O at \(4750\text{--}5000~\mathrm{K}\).
    \item Carbon--hydrogen demixing and nanodiamond nucleation consistent
