\end{itemize}

\subsection*{2.2 Magnetohydrodynamic Dynamo Modeling}
UUAS resolves the full MHD behavior of Uranus, including:
\begin{itemize}
    \item Non-dipolar, multipolar magnetic field generation.
    \item Helical flux-bundle formation and plasmoid pinch-off.
    \item Rotation-coupled magnetotail dynamics.
    \item Thin-shell dynamo operation driven by superionic and polymeric layers.
\end{itemize}

\subsection*{2.3 Encrypted Telemetry and Secure Computation}
The simulation integrates fully homomorphic encryption (FHE) into
planetary modeling pipelines, enabling:
\begin{itemize}
    \item Zero-leakage ingestion of JWST and laboratory spectra.
    \item Bit-perfect data fidelity under simulated radiation stress.
    \item Secure multi-node HPC computation across distributed architectures.
\end{itemize}

